# Copy to .env (gitignored) and run scripts with `node --env-file=.env <script>`.
# Local scripts read DATABASE_URL via shared/db.mjs,
# db/migrate.mjs, and web/src/lib/data.ts; without it they fall back to the
# local dev database postgresql://root@127.0.0.1:5432/gpx.
#
# Supabase project `nsnexplorer` → Project Settings → Database → Connection string.
# Use the *Session* pooler (port 5432) here: COPY, prepared statements, and
# multi-statement migrations all work. Never use the Transaction pooler (6543)
# for migrations or the copy script; it is only for the Pages Function.
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres.<project-ref>:<password>@aws-0-us-east-1.pooler.supabase.com:5432/postgres

# Only needed while db/copy-from-neon.mjs is still in use (source database).
# NEON_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://...
